color_light_recipe:
HEADER: saturated violet (#B238FB at the top to about #A035F0), flat, with a very faint tone-on-tone tiled brand-glyph pattern (about 5% contrast). The lower lip has a light lilac rim (#E0AAFE) over a deep purple underside (#5A1FA0 to #501A92), which casts a shadow onto the scene. The header's mean luminance is about 120-125, while the scene's middle zone is brighter at about 150-180, so the eye falls from the caption into a bright center.
SCENES: a soft, painted 3D-render look. The key light comes from the top or back, with strong rim light on characters and props, bloom halos behind hero objects, small white four-point sparkles and translucent cream-yellow motion ribbons. Each shot has ONE dominant ambient hue, and the gallery strip alternates:
shot 1: cyan pool and cobalt underwater (#65DDE9, #1F208B);
shot 2: sunset magenta and peach with a red mat (#BE526E, #E7AE77, #CA2628);
shot 3: an orange-yellow sunburst (#FFDF91, #FFBD43, #F26B2D);
shot 4: grass green with a blue wheel (#51AE78, #69C073);
shot 5: sky and cyan banners with one orange lead row (#45B4D0, #5CE4E5);
shot 6: teal jungle night (#33C8C0, #0C8E9E, #2C4A55).
The brand's backbone is a complementary pair: a violet frame against the warm orange mascot and gold type. The set runs warm through shots 2-5 and finishes cool in shot 6.

One flat warm-neutral canvas (peach ~#FAE7D9) stays identical in all 8 shots and matches the game's own background, so the whole set reads as one poster series. The HUD uses a slightly darker tan pill (~#EACAB1) with brown text (~#B3714F).
The saturated color comes only from gameplay pieces: pure mid-value red, blue, green, purple and orange tubes, so the puzzle pops hard against the soft ground.
The band is a warm golden yellow (~#FFD94A at the top, ~#FECF3B lower), with a pale cream-to-white highlight rim on its wave edge.
The caption outline is amber-brown, a darker cousin of the band color, so the text feels printed on the band and not pasted on.
Lighting is almost entirely flat. Glow shows up only on 'moments':
- a soft yellow outline around the selected piece;
- gold motion streaks with 2-3 fading ghost copies behind flying collectibles;
- a white radial bloom plus 4-point sparkles behind the booster;
- a small spark burst on bombs.
The mascot is a fully rendered 3D-style character (soft subsurface fur, specular eyes, contact shadow). It is the only volumetric element, which makes it jump forward, though it doesn't match the flat game art.
